{"type":"message-part","messageId":"ac611fe3-7ef4-4574-ae96-f81924048175","role":"assistant","index":26,"part":{"type":"tool-attemptCompletion","toolCallId":"QEuCziNY23IPvnkv","state":"input-available","input":{"result":"I have implemented the pagination logic for listing WorkOS organization memberships.\n\n1.  **Script Created**: I created `/home/user/myproject/list_memberships.js` which:\n    - Initializes the WorkOS client using `WORKOS_API_KEY`.\n    - Paginates through memberships for `WORKOS_ORGANIZATION_ID` with a limit of 2 per page.\n    - Maps the results to the required format: `{ id, user_id, organization_id, status }`.\n    - Writes the final array to `/home/user/myproject/memberships.json`.\n2.  **Execution**: I ran the script using `node list_memberships.js`.\n3.  **Verification**: The script successfully fetched and saved the memberships to `memberships.json`.\n\n**File contents of `list_memberships.js`:**\n```javascript\nconst { WorkOS } = require('@workos-inc/node');\nconst fs = require('fs');\n\nconst apiKey = process.env.WORKOS_API_KEY;\nconst organizationId = process.env.WORKOS_ORGANIZATION_ID;\n\nif (!apiKey || !organizationId) {\n  console.error('Missing WORKOS_API_KEY or WORKOS_ORGANIZATION_ID');\n  process.exit(1);\n}\n\nconst workos = new WorkOS(apiKey);\n\nasync function listMemberships() {\n  let allMemberships = [];\n  let after = undefined;\n\n  try {\n    do {\n      const response = await workos.userManagement.listOrganizationMemberships({\n        organizationId,\n        limit: 2,\n        after,\n      });\n\n      const memberships = response.data.map((m) => ({\n        id: m.id,\n        user_id: m.userId,\n        organization_id: m.organizationId,\n        status: m.status,\n      }));\n\n      allMemberships = allMemberships.concat(memberships);\n      after = response.listMetadata.after;\n    } while (after);\n\n    fs.writeFileSync(\n      '/home/user/myproject/memberships.json',\n      JSON.stringify(allMemberships, null, 2)\n    );\n    console.log(`Saved ${allMemberships.length} memberships to memberships.json`);\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Error fetching memberships:', error);\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n}\n\nlistMemberships();\n```\n\n**Output in `memberships.json`:**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"om_01KRJX1PRBCW878Z638CEQQDH5\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user_01KPZRDZ5CSAS297YDBCNQDPZY\",\n    \"organization_id\": \"REDACTED\",\n    \"status\": \"active\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"om_01KRJX1PR4KM1XJRWW97P53SZC\",\n    \"user_id\": \"REDACTED\",\n    \"organization_id\": \"REDACTED\",\n    \"status\": \"active\"\n  }\n]\n```"},"callProviderMetadata":{"vertex":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
